WEBVTT

00:08:29.004 --> 00:08:30.172
When we get there,

00:08:30.214 --> 00:08:32.841
we will have been able to erase
the carbon footprint

00:08:32.883 --> 00:08:34.385
of the chemical industry.

00:08:34.677 --> 00:08:37.680
And while we won't be able to bring
our tropical glaciers back,

00:08:37.680 --> 00:08:40.015
we will have helped to develop
a sustainable path

00:08:40.015 --> 00:08:41.475
for the future of our planet.

00:08:41.475 --> 00:08:42.643
Thank you.

00:08:42.643 --> 00:08:45.229
(Applause)